        "locator": "title and description",
        "excerpt": "PR (cited in the notes as #21333): fix: Stabilize on-deployed notification trigger [closed]\nFixes #9070\n\nThis PR attempts to stabilize the `on-deployed` notifications trigger. Previously, false positives were sent due to the way status updates are handled by the `application-controller`. For more details refer https://github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/issues/9070#issuecomment-1909836122.\n\nA new condition is added to ensure notification is not triggered when app status is in progress. This is done by checking `app.status.operationState.finishedAt` with newly introduced field",
